        "info": "Press one of the inject buttons to set the shared state `exampleRoomOccupied`.\nEvery shared state is also available in the global context under `state`. On each change, a function node reads it with `global.get(\"state\").exampleRoomOccupied.value` and a change node sets `msg.occupied` from `global.state.exampleRoomOccupied.value`. Both send the value to the debug sidebar. Any other message could trigger the same reads.\n\nPersist is set to Off, so nothing is written to disk."
